{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Store It! you run a small storage facility where new customers drop off their belongings every day</strong> \u2013 from TVs and potted plants to massive carpets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job? Stack everything as efficiently as possible, keep it organized, and find it quickly when customers return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sounds easy?</strong><br>Just wait until space runs out, fragile items show up, and your customers start getting impatient...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf2 <strong>First-person physics gameplay</strong><br>Grab boxes, furniture, plants, fridges and more with your gravity gun. Stack with logic \u2013 or embrace the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Limited space, rising pressure</strong><br>Every item needs a place. But you never know when it\u2019s coming back out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Fragile? Absolutely.</strong><br>Some things should <i>definitely</i> not go on the bottom\u2026 or crash into a wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Earn money, upgrade your storage</strong><br>Buy shelves, hooks and tools to make your storage space a little more manageable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong><br>Short sessions, growing pressure, and more and more stuff. Pure storage madness.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801520?t=1752682036","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3801520?t=1752682036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/37511e50428ba0920bc0e5302c28548a5d68d8f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752682036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3801520/37511e50428ba0920bc0e5302c28548a5d68d8f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752682036","categories":[{"descript